{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/198123-specialty-stacking","id":198123,"title":"Specialty stacking","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-15T12:38:57-07:00","id":198123,"title":"Specialty stacking","content":"Do specialties stack in OWoD?<br /> <br /> Example: Having a specialty for Dexterity for martial arts, and having Brawl with a specialty in punching, would I roll 1 or 2 extra dice on a 10 for the dicepool? Also on the exploding dice, do the 1's negate a success still?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-15T13:57:08-07:00","id":198199,"title":"","content":"A few things:<br /> <br /> 1) To answer the basic question: no, with the exception of the Dark Ages Revised rules which changes to &quot;sort of.&quot;<br /> <br /> 2) Dexterity specialties shouldn't be in specific Abilities. Attributes use very broad ones like &quot;flexible.&quot;<br /> <br /> 3) And yes, 1s still negate successes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","